riant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; background-color: rgb(141, 226, 224); text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><b>&lt; OPTIONAL CONTENT BLOCK - TO BE POPULATED BY AM, BASED ON RELEVANCE (see options below) &gt;</b></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">If you have any questions or would like to discuss the above, or anything else related to your Qantas relationship, please feel free to call me on {!User.Phone}.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Thank you again for being a valued Qantas customer - we're thrilled to have you on board.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Kind regards,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">{!User.Name}</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; background-color: rgb(141, 226, 224); text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">CONTENT BLOCKS - VARIABLE. Most appropriate selected and inserted by AM. Content blocks to be updated and added to progressively and should be accessed via a centralised content library hosted in Salesforce (Matt to advise where etc)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><table style="height: 20px; line-height: 20px; width: 600px;"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px;"><span style="margin: 0px;">1.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><b>On-time performance:</b></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;">We know that getting away on time is one of the most important parts of flying experience. It is for us too and we're continually working hard to make sure our on-time performance is class leading.<br><br>If you or your team would like to check your flight status, simply click 'Flight Status' within your Qantas app or visit&nbsp;<a class="underline three" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/flight-status.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;">https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/flight-status.html</a>&nbsp;and enter your upcoming flight details. You're able to manage your flight notifications so that you can ensure you're always informed of any changes or updates, up until departure.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><span style="margin: 0px;">2.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><b>Update your contact details:</b></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;">Do we have the latest details on record for you and your travellers? It's important that for every booking, we have the most appropriate contact details for the person flying. We use this data to communicate any changes to flight schedules or bookings in general. To ensure traveller's details are correct, they can click 'Manage my booking' within the Qantas app or visit&nbsp;<a class="underline three" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;">https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking.html</a>&nbsp;to update their details.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px;"><span style="margin: 0px;">3.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><b>We'd love you for to join us:&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(249, 243, 233);">(may require disclaimer - i.e. non-transferrable, event dependant etc)</span></b></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;">As a valued Qantas customer, we would love to invite you to our upcoming event - &lt; insert event name/details &gt;. If you're free to join us, please let me know directly by responding to this email.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px;"><span style="margin: 0px;">4.</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;"><b>Save on Qantas Club membership:<sup class="salesforce_curl" style="font-size: small; line-height: 0px;">^</sup></b></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; width: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; min-height: 20px; padding-left: 2px;">We are pleased to offer our valued Business customers a 38% discount off the Qantas Club joining fee and 22% discount off annual membership fees. Qantas Club members enjoy a streamlined check-in process, extra baggage and the ability to work or relax in style pre-flight in our lounges. Qantas Club members can access 24 domestic Qantas Clubs and over 600 partner lounges internationally. To find out more, visit&nbsp;<a class="underline three" href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;">https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/the-qantas-club.html</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-